  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nDiscover our newest collection from Leia Bryans \n\nPrints\nOriginals\nArt Objects\nShop by Artist\nGift Cards\nAbout\nCart\n\nOUR MISSION\n\nWe believe fine art should be available to everyone. We curate affordably priced pieces from the most exciting up-and-coming artists.\n\nMEET THE FOUNDER\n\nAshley Mulvihill\n\nAshley Mulvihill launched the gallery to bring engaging artwork by contemporary, emerging artists to a broader audience. Ashley strives to open up the world of art to new collectors and make them feel more comfortable building their collection with original works.\n\nFueled by a passion for working with emerging artists and motivated by the idea that everyone should have access to real art, Ninth Editions was launched to connect the two worlds.\n\nAshley has a decade of experience working in the art world both locally and internationally. She has worked with organizations like the Peggy Guggenheim Collection in Italy, England’s Queen Elizabeth Scholarship Trust, and continues to curate major exhibitions at Drake Hotel Properties in Toronto, as well as public art project across Canada.\n\nWe would love to work with you.\n\nIf you are a new or seasoned collector, artist, potential partner, or simply curious about anything we do, please get in touch.\n\nName\nEmail *\nPhone number\nComment\nSend\nShop\nPrints\nOriginals\nArt Objects\nGift Cards\nSearch\nInfo\nOur Story\nJournal\nContact\nOur mission\n\nWe curate affordably priced pieces from the most exciting up-and-coming artists.\n\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-studio-demo Powered by Shopify"
